      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have this really painful red bump on my arm like it's swollen and feels super warm when i touch it. it's been getting bigger for like two days and it's starting to throb. i really dont wanna spend the money at urgent care right now... do u think i could just use a needle to drain it myself at home? i have alcohol and everything so i can clean it up properly",
